    "q-68842": {
      "dom_id": "step-q68842",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "$2÷\\frac{2}{5}\\times 4=$",
      "worked_solution": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nWe divide and multiply, from left to right:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2÷\\frac{2}{5}\\times 4 & = \\\\ (2÷\\frac{2}{5})\\times 4 & = \\\\ (2\\times \\frac{5}{2})\\times 4 & = \\\\ (\\frac{2}{1}\\times \\frac{5}{2})\\times 4 & = \\\\ \\frac{2\\times 5}{1\\times 2}\\times 4 & = \\\\ \\frac{\\cancel{2}\\times 5}{1\\times \\cancel{2}}\\times 4 & = \\\\ 5\\times 4 & = \\\\ 20\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
