      "problem": "$(-4)\\times (2.3-0.1)=${{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "To evaluate this expression, we use PEMDAS.\n\nFirst, we perform the operation inside the parentheses:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-4)\\times (2.3-0.1) & = \\\\ (-4)\\times 2.2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we multiply:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(-4)\\times 2.2 & =-8.8\\end{aligned}\n$$",
